%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: IaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You look like someone who reads the last page first. Ia Lomidze, librarian at the archive on the hill. Twenty years now.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: "People bring me their questions \u2014 what will happen, what comes next. As if the answer's filed in my stacks."
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Is it?
      npcResponse: Everything is, eventually. The difficulty is finding which shelf.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: What do you tell them?
      npcResponse: That endings are written long before anyone reads them. They never find that comforting.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "The library's still open \u2014 I open it every morning. Fewer people every day, but I live alone. Books are better company."
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I've already read past this part of the story. I don't say that to unsettle you. My papers are here, December expiry.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: What happens next?
      npcResponse: To you? I wouldn't say. Some things are better as a surprise.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: That's an unusual thing to say at a checkpoint.
      npcResponse: Everything unusual feels ordinary when the plot requires it.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
